    "introHtml": "<p>In C, integers come in fixed sizes:</p><pre><code>uint8_t  = 8 bits, unsigned, range 0 to 255\nint32_t  = 32 bits, signed, range roughly -2 billion to +2 billion\nuint64_t = 64 bits, unsigned, very large range</code></pre><p>In crunch-c, these are: u8, i32, u64, etc. Let's see how they behave.</p>",
